sections.assessment:
Assessment:
1) in the 1st period: assignments and mini-tests + a theoretical exam;
2) in the 2nd/special period: TP exam evaluating both T+TP components. Students with < 8.5/20 in either the T exam or TP assessments will not be approved. Assessment. Student must attend at least ¾ of the TP classes to pass. Continuous assessment will also be considered, in which students are assessed in all possible ways. For this purpose, homework, response to challenges, participation in the classroom, interactions with professors, in person and/or via email, will be considered.

