2. Statistical data analysis of economics and business data: methods and techniques:
- Main concepts;
- Data reduction;
- Absolute and relative variations;
- Index numbers;
- Time series;
- Relationships between variables.
3. Analysis of information: methods and techniques:
- Search procedures;
- Analysis of information: techniques;
- Data sources.
4. Writing economics data statistical analysis reports:
- Writing reports;
- Preparing presentations.

